  "priorExpiration": "2016-11-21",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5703.06 Criminal Record Check Fee.\n\n(a) The cost of a criminal record check shall be $25.00 unless Saf-C 5703.07 applies.\n\n(b) The $25.00 fee shall be charged regardless of whether the inquiry results in a criminal record or information indicating there is not a criminal record.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 5700) #6704, eff 3-3-98; ss by #8173, eff 9-21-04; ss by #9329, eff 11-21-08, EXPIRED: 11-21-16\n\nNew. #12132, eff 3-17-17",
